sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State: State is EnergyTransferStarted for <Configured evseId>

    loop Every <Configured clock-aligned Meter Values interval>, until <Configured transaction duration> is reached
        loop For evseId=0 and all configured idle EVSE
            alt Meter Values reported via MeterValuesRequest
                CS->>CSMS: MeterValuesRequest (timestamp = <aligned to configured clock-aligned Meter Values interval>, sampledValue.context = Sample.Clock)
                CSMS-->>CS: MeterValuesResponse
            else Meter Values reported via NotifyEventRequest
                CS->>CSMS: NotifyEventRequest (timestamp = <aligned to configured clock-aligned Meter Values interval>, trigger = Periodic, component.name = FiscalMetering)
                CSMS-->>CS: NotifyEventResponse
            end
        end
        CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (triggerReason = MeterValueClock, eventType = Updated, timestamp = <aligned to configured clock-aligned Meter Values interval>, sampledValue.context = Sample.Clock)
        CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse
    end
    Note over CS,CSMS: The Test System ends the testcase after the <Configured transaction duration> is reached
